component ensures your faucet maintains optimal performance, delivering consistent, dependable functionality for years to come.</p><p></p><p></p>","width":"33%","alignment":"center","align_text":"left","text_size":"medium","text_color":"black","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"sf__btn-primary","button_size":"","block_custom_class":"","animations":"inherit"}},"f5c04800-559b-41f3-9466-57adb830001d":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"<h3 style=\"color: #34A3EF; font-weight: bold;\"> Versatile 2-Spray Mode </h3>","subheading":"","text":"<h3>Customizable Flow for All Your Kitchen Task</h3><p>Enjoy enhanced flexibility in your kitchen tasks with the 2-spray mode feature. Easily toggle between a steady stream for filling pots and a powerful spray for tackling tough messes. This convenient function allows for quick adjustments, making every washing and cleaning task more efficient and effective.</p>","width":"33%","alignment":"center","align_text":"left","text_size":"medium","text_color":"black","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"sf__btn-primary","button_size":"","block_custom_class":"","animations":"inherit"}},"7043ffb4-1f13-4535-985e-e5cd899f6a00":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify://shop_images/Spray_Mode_2a707d9a-12cb-43d9-9fae-80f4822e35db.jpg","link":"","width":"66%","alignment":"center","block_custom_class":"","animations":"inherit"}},"4f650aa1-b21f-4880-b2c2-8c99ba61989f":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify://shop_images/Pull_Out_Hose_02bbf095-8719-4c0f-bae9-6f267243a7d1.jpg","link":"","width":"66%","alignment":"center","block_custom_class":"","animations":"inherit"}},"0d5b310f-1802-4335-855d-51c9cdca6678":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"<h3 style=\"color: #34A3EF; font-weight: bold;\">Flexible Pull-Out Hose </h3>","subheading":"","text":"<h3>Extended Reach for Effortless Cleaning </h3><p>The pull-out hose feature offers a 20-inch extension, giving you the flexibility to reach every corner of your sink with ea